    {
      "id": "stat.rv.variance_def",
      "node_kind": "definition",
      "name": "方差定义式与展开公式",
      "aliases": [
        "方差计算式"
      ],
      "latex": "D(X) = E[(X - E(X))^2] = E(X^2) - [E(X)]^2",
      "statement": "方差度量随机变量偏离其期望的离散程度，计算上常化为“平方的期望减去期望的平方”。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": [
          "mathematics",
          "statistics"
        ],
        "education_stages": [
          "senior_high",
          "undergraduate"
        ],
        "topics": [
          "expectation_variance"
        ]
      },
      "variables": [
        {
          "symbol": "D(X)",
          "name": "方差（亦记 Var(X)）",
          "math_type": "scalar",
          "domain": "[0, +\\infty)",
          "quantity_kind": null,
          "dimension": null,
          "si_unit": null
        }
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "E(X²) 存在；标准差 σ = √D(X)"
      ],
      "review": {
        "status": "human_verified",
        "source": "概率论与数理统计 4.2",
        "sympy_verified": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stat.rv.variance_props",
      "node_kind": "formula",
      "name": "方差伸缩与独立可加性质",
      "aliases": [
        "方差运算法则"
      ],
      "latex": "D(aX + b) = a^2 D(X),\\quad D(X \\pm Y) = D(X) + D(Y)",
      "statement": "常数平移不改变方差，缩放 a 倍使方差变为 a² 倍；两独立随机变量之和或差的方差均等于各自方差之和。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": [
          "mathematics",
          "statistics"
        ],
        "education_stages": [
          "senior_high",
          "undergraduate"
        ],
        "topics": [
          "expectation_variance"
        ]
      },
      "variables": [
        {
          "symbol": "a, b",
          "name": "实常数",
          "math_type": "constant",
          "domain": "\\mathbb{R}",
          "quantity_kind": null,
          "dimension": null,
          "si_unit": null
        }
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "D(X ± Y) = D(X) + D(Y) 要求 X 与 Y 相互独立（或至少不相关）"
      ],
      "review": {
        "status": "human_verified",
        "source": "概率论与数理统计 4.2",
        "sympy_verified": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stat.rv.covariance",
      "node_kind": "definition",
      "name": "协方差公式",
      "aliases": [
        "两变量协方差"
      ],
      "latex": "\\text{Cov}(X, Y) = E(XY) - E(X)E(Y)",
      "statement": "协方差度量两个随机变量协同变化的方向与强度，是方差概念向二维随机变量的自然推广。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": [
          "mathematics",
          "statistics"
        ],
        "education_stages": [
          "undergraduate"
        ],
        "topics": [
          "expectation_variance"
        ]
      },
      "variables": [
        {
          "symbol": "\\text{Cov}(X, Y)",
          "name": "协方差",
          "math_type": "scalar",
          "domain": "\\mathbb{R}",
          "quantity_kind": null,
          "dimension": null,
          "si_unit": null
        }
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "E(X²), E(Y²) 存在；若 X、Y 独立则 Cov(X, Y) = 0（逆命题一般不成立）"
      ],
      "review": {
        "status": "human_verified",
        "source": "概率论与数理统计 4.3",
        "sympy_verified": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stat.rv.correlation",
      "node_kind": "definition",
      "name": "皮尔逊相关系数",
      "aliases": [
        "线性相关系数 ρ"
      ],
      "latex": "\\rho_{XY} = \\frac{\\text{Cov}(X, Y)}{\\sqrt{D(X)}\\sqrt{D(Y)}}",
      "statement": "将协方差除以两变量标准差之积实现无量纲标准化，取值恒在 [-1, 1] 之间以度量线性相关强弱。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": [
          "mathematics",
          "statistics"
        ],
        "education_stages": [
